OL,3,AVet prescription fees capped under rule
OL,4,Achanges
OL,5,
OL,6,FWritten prescription fees from vets
OL,7,Fwill be capped at #21 as part of a raft
OL,8,Fof changes that practices will be
OL,9,Flegally required to bring in over the
OL,10,Fcoming months.
OL,12,FVets must also tell clients if cheaper
OL,13,Fmedicine is available online, write
OL,14,Fprice estimates ahead of treatment, and
OL,15,Fpublish price lists for services as
OL,16,Fpart of the rule updates.
OL,18,FThe official competition watchdog has
OL,19,Fbrought the measures into force after
OL,20,Fits investigation into the sector found
OL,21,Fprices had been rising at nearly twice
OL,22,Fthe rate of inflation.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,110,105,200,300,0,100
